From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saurabh Jhanjee <jhanjeesaurabh@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:10:12 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] update: select tags by a per-input version regex

[update.inputs.<id>] version_regex filters an input's candidate tags
and its single capture group is the version compared, as nix-update's
--version-regex does. It holds a release line (v(5\..*)) or picks one
product of a repository that tags several (bolt-v(.*)). The regex is
validated when the config is loaded.
